Mon Nov 16 10:49:10 UTC 2026 - Sai Karthik Karra <kskarthik@disroot.org>

- Update to version 1.11.0:
  * Bump shared library major version to 9 (libsndio9) due to
    extended display strings and control names in struct
    sioctl_desc.
  * aucat: Use reallocarray from libbsd.
  * aucat: Factor channel join and expand routines.
  * sndiod: Identify MIDI ports by names instead of indices on the
    wire and support midithru control with sndioctl.
  * sndiod: Drop dead code and simplify hello message handling and
    Unix socket binding.
  * sndiod: Add dynamic mode settings via server.mode control.
  * libsndio: Add sio_onxrun(3) to report buffer underruns.
  * libsndio: Preserve POLLERR bits and improve error handling.
- Packaging changes:
  * Rename libsndio7 to libsndio9 per shared library policy.
  * Remove obsolete --with-libbsd configure flag (libbsd is default
    on Linux).
  * Fix configure script hardcoding version=1.10.0 so that
    sndio.pc advertises version 1.11.0.
  * Explicitly specify --mandir=%{_mandir} in configure.
  * Drop obsolete Group tags.
  * Add explicit BuildRequires for gcc and make.

